18 Nov 2026: SELECT and WHERE

What I learned:

Simple SELECT queries
Filtering rows with WHERE
For numbers, WHERE uses =, >, <, BETWEEN ... AND, NOT BETWEEN ... AND
For text: =, !=, LIKE, NOT LIKE, IN (...), NOT IN (...)
Wildcards only work with LIKE: % = any number of characters, _ = exactly one character (e.g. LIKE '%text%')
Text values need to be in quotes

